  "notes": "One faction for the US Army and US Marine Corps. Branch-specific kit: USMC = AH-1Z, ACV (AAV-7 retired Sep 2025), JLTV, M27 IAR, SMAW, MARPAT, HIMARS, no tanks; Army = Abrams, Bradley, Stryker, AH-64E, UH-60, JLTV/M-ATV/MaxxPro, OCP, NGSW (M7/M250) entering service. 2025 Army Transformation Initiative stopped Humvee/JLTV procurement, M10 Booker, Gray Eagle and AH-64D. Early-game patron for counter-terror work in the Middle East and Horn of Africa. Game assignment of which vehicles the US faction fields in each theatre (and whether the player can buy MRAPs/Bradley/Abrams) remains an open design question; the vehicles list records real-world use.",
